<p>Aloir Apparel operates from the United States, with US fulfillment through Trendsi.</p>
<h2 id="delivery-destinations">Destinations &amp; delivery estimates</h2>
<p>For US-stocked products delivered to US addresses, Trendsi lists standard shipping at approximately <strong>2–5 business days</strong>. This is an estimate, not a guaranteed arrival date. Check the individual product and the options available for your address before payment. Weekends, holidays and carrier interruptions may affect timing.</p>
<p>Our US fulfillment selection does not imply worldwide delivery. Available destinations, including territories, military addresses and P.O. boxes, depend on the item and checkout eligibility. Overseas-stocked merchandise has a different timeframe and must be identified separately if offered.</p>
<h2 id="delivery-charges">Shipping charges</h2>
<p>Review the final delivery charge at checkout before placing an order. It depends on the items, shipment weight and destination. Supplier shipping rates are not a promise of the rate charged by Aloir Apparel. Any applicable delivery surcharge must be included in the total shown before you pay. Expedited and overnight service are not currently offered through Trendsi standard dropshipping.</p>
<h2 id="delivery-tracking">Tracking &amp; separate packages</h2>
<p>Tracking details are provided when your order is dispatched. Items may arrive in separate packages; follow the tracking for each shipment. Check your delivery address carefully and report an error immediately under our <a href="/pages/cancellation-policy">cancellation policy</a>.</p>
<h2 id="delivery-help">Delays, missing or damaged deliveries</h2>
<p>If we cannot ship within the timeframe stated when you ordered, we will notify you, provide a revised estimate and offer the choice to accept the delay or cancel the unshipped merchandise for a prompt refund, as required by applicable law. A carrier estimate does not remove these rights.</p>
<p>For a missing parcel, incorrect item or damage, {% render 'policy-contact' %} with your order number, tracking details and photographs where relevant. We will investigate and explain the available remedy; do not send a package back without return instructions.</p>
